{
 "name": "HL · Consent at checkout → Brevo",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Consent at checkout -> Brevo (Lesson 5.6)\nCalled by the payment workflow (HL·03) after a verified payment.\n- Ticked the unticked box \"Send me weekly prices and offers\"? -> create or update the Brevo contact (FIRSTNAME, SEGMENT, FAV_CATEGORY, LAST_ORDER_DATE, USUAL_ORDER_DAY), add to the list \"Customers · opted in\", store consent_at and consent_source in Supabase.\n- Not ticked -> never added. If they opted in earlier (and haven't left), only LAST_ORDER_DATE is updated so the win-back stops.\nAn email from an order is not consent.\n\nCredentials: Header Auth \"Brevo API key\" (Name api-key, Value your Brevo API key); Postgres (Supabase).\nPlaceholders: YOUR_BREVO_LIST_ID.\nMailchimp instead: Mailchimp node, Member -> Create, with tags.",
    "height": 380,
    "width": 560
   },
   "id": "06261417-bdeb-4696-a633-53d83fae45ee",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -620,
    -400
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## In Brevo, not n8n\nAutomations (free plan, up to 2,000 contacts):\n- Welcome: contact added to list -> email 1 -> wait 3 days -> email 2 -> wait 4 days -> email 3.\n- Win-back: LAST_ORDER_DATE is 60 days old -> win-back email (offer only from Tolu's approved list); stops if they order.\n- Re-order reminder: the day before USUAL_ORDER_DAY.\nAuthenticate mail.harvestlane.example first: Brevo's DKIM and verification records, DMARC v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:dmarc@harvestlane.example, and one SPF record only, ending in ~all.\n\n-- Run once in Supabase\ncreate table marketing_consent (\n  email text primary key,\n  consent_at timestamptz,\n  consent_source text,\n  status text default 'subscribed',  -- subscribed | unsubscribed | hard_bounce | complaint\n  suppressed_at timestamptz);",
    "height": 420,
    "width": 560
   },
   "id": "c2eedce4-f6b6-466f-852a-b64923f8636a",
   "name": "Brevo setup",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -620,
    20
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {},
   "id": "4c6bac5c-06d8-40e6-ae4b-8018680d7bb2",
   "name": "When called after a verified payment",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "return { ...$json, email: String($json.email || '').trim().toLowerCase(), consent: $json.marketing_consent === true };\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
   },
   "id": "fbe28004-1ae6-4a06-b64d-9a1dd162a3ec",
   "name": "Normalise",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    220,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "conditions": {
     "options": {
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "leftValue": "",
      "typeValidation": "loose"
     },
     "conditions": [
      {
       "id": "76382644-746f-4f10-a8ed-28f08f7e372d",
       "leftValue": "={{ $json.consent }}",
       "rightValue": "",
       "operator": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "operation": "true",
        "singleValue": true
       }
      }
     ],
     "combinator": "and"
    },
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "c0aaca72-b9c2-4193-b48e-0ff7dbf1b4c7",
   "name": "Ticked the box?",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    440,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "https://api.brevo.com/v3/contacts",
    "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
    "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
    "sendBody": true,
    "specifyBody": "json",
    "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ email: $json.email, updateEnabled: true, listIds: [ Number('YOUR_BREVO_LIST_ID') ], attributes: { FIRSTNAME: $json.first_name, SEGMENT: $json.segment, FAV_CATEGORY: $json.fav_category, LAST_ORDER_DATE: $json.order_date, USUAL_ORDER_DAY: $json.usual_order_day } }) }}",
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "06599206-3c01-46e6-bcff-50ed5d4be48c",
   "name": "Brevo · create or update contact",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    660,
    -90
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "executeQuery",
    "query": "insert into marketing_consent (email, consent_at, consent_source, status)\nvalues ($1, now(), $2, 'subscribed')\non conflict (email) do update set consent_at = now(), consent_source = excluded.consent_source, status = 'subscribed', suppressed_at = null;",
    "options": {
     "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $('Normalise').item.json.email, $('Normalise').item.json.consent_source || 'checkout' ] }}"
    }
   },
   "id": "d7738726-0101-458f-86ac-f48670e5123c",
   "name": "Store consent",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
   "typeVersion": 2.5,
   "position": [
    880,
    -90
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "executeQuery",
    "query": "select email from marketing_consent where email = $1 and status = 'subscribed';",
    "options": {
     "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.email ] }}"
    }
   },
   "id": "507a61f8-8148-49b1-a49e-f8703f002f27",
   "name": "Already opted in?",
